<title>UK: USF&amp;G Corp boosts position in Lloyd's market.</title>
<headline>USF&amp;G Corp boosts position in Lloyd's market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USF&amp;G Corp said on Friday it had boosted its presence in the Lloyd's of London insurance market through the acquisition of Ashley Palmer Ltd.</p>
<p>The deal gives USF&amp;G capacity of $300 million for 1997. Some members of the Ashley Palmer company will retain a 20 percent stake in the venture. The deal is subject to Lloyd's approval.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
